** If '''Neeko''' has no {{as|'''bonus''' AD}}, she will not deal damage.
** However, '''Neeko's''' {{tip|critical strikes}} while disguised will deal {{as|{{critical damage|{{ccd|Neeko|crit_base}}|100|mod={{ccd|Neeko|crit_mod}}}} '''total''' AD}} {{as|physical damage}} as expected.<!--feel free to rephrase this one: point is crits do the same damage as on any other unit-->
